# Frontend UI

Follow `.agents/skills/frontend/SKILL.md` for full detail.

- **Colocate**: page-only UI in `-components/`; shared (2+ pages) in `src/components/<kebab-name>/`.
- **Tokens only**: style with utilities from `globals.css` / `@theme`; never hardcode hex/`oklch` in components. See `references/theme.md`.
- **Min type size**: no `text-[10px]`-style arbitrary micro sizes.
- **Icons**: `lucide-react` for new icons.
- **Mutations**: `refetchQueries` with exact keys — not blanket `invalidateQueries`.
- **Minimal UI**: content over chrome, quiet until hover, one primary CTA. Avoid AI-slop patterns in `references/minimalism.md`.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div className="bg-[#1a1a2e] text-[10px]">…</div>
queryClient.invalidateQueries()

// ✅ GOOD
<div className="bg-slate-dark text-caption">…</div>
queryClient.refetchQueries({ queryKey: NOTIFICATIONS_KEY })
```
